{"id": "33896", "title": "管家婆", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33896.htm", "intro": "虽然学长曾耳提面命的提醒过她──他的宝贝弟弟非常的与众不同，但她却认为不过就是照顾个人何难之有，偏偏一见面，他就给她取了个难听称号，让她对他的第一印象真的是糟透了！又老半夜不睡跑来敲她房门吵著要宵夜，不帮他就摆出小可怜的姿态控诉她，喂！明明是他扰人清梦，怎么搞得她觉得自己是虐儿的坏后母？而且没事老爱缠著问她十万个为什么，就在她快被逼疯之际家里出了点事，她当然二话不说包袱款款溜之大吉，谁知这个怪胎居然穷追不舍跟到台湾来，说什么他还有好多疑惑没有解答……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33896", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2155533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2155534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2155535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2155536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2155537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2155538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2155539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2155540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2155541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2155542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2155543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2155544.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2155545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2155546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2155547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2155548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2155549.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2155550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2155551.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2155552.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2155553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2155554.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2155555.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2155556.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2155557.